"""
phase_ablation.py
===================
Preprocessing Ablation Study

Tests 4 preprocessing strategies to eliminate the acquisition shortcut
intrinsic to ChestX6, aiming to force the DANN to learn pathology instead
of scanner/image-processing signatures.

Experiments:
  1. Histogram Matching (ChestX6 matched to NIH distribution)
  2. Z-score Standardization (Per-image normalization)
  3. CLAHE + Histogram Matching
  4. Frequency Suppression (Blur + Downsample/Upsample)

Metrics per method:
  - Disease AUC (Real labels)
  - Domain Accuracy (Real labels)
  - Random-label AUC (Shuffled labels)
"""

